sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户 / 麦克风
    participant UI as lvglsim AI 页面
    participant Router as backend_command_router
    participant AI as service_ai_runtime
    participant LED as service_led
    participant BT as service_bt
    participant Tuya as Tuya chatbot 进程
    participant Model as 离线 MNN 唤醒/KWS
    participant Cloud as 涂鸦 AI / MQTT
    participant Audio as ALSA 扬声器

    Note over AI,Tuya: service_ai_init() 读取运行时 License；凭据不进入通用固件
    AI->>Tuya: fork + execl(your_chat_bot_QIO_1.0.1.bin)
    Tuya->>Model: 加载“你好涂鸦”唤醒模型
    UI->>Router: TOPIC_AI_COMMAND / AI_CMD_ENTER_FREE_CHAT
    Router->>AI: service_ai_enter_free_chat()
    AI->>AI: service_ai_start_listen()
    AI->>BT: 暂停/抑制蓝牙播放冲突
    AI->>LED: request 聆听场景
    User->>Tuya: PCM 语音输入
    Tuya->>Tuya: 唤醒 + AEC + VAD
    Tuya->>Cloud: 加密连接、ASR/对话请求
    Cloud-->>Tuya: 流式文本 + TTS 音频
    Tuya-->>AI: 状态/文本事件
    AI-->>UI: TOPIC_AI_STATUS + TOPIC_AI_TEXT
    AI->>LED: 思考 / 说话场景（25 Hz 上限、重复帧抑制）
    Tuya->>Audio: 播放 TTS
    Note over User,Tuya: 真人说话可打断；扬声器泄漏不得触发错误 barge-in
    UI->>Router: AI_CMD_EXIT_FREE_CHAT
    Router->>AI: service_ai_exit_free_chat()
    AI->>AI: service_ai_stop_listen()
    AI->>BT: 延迟恢复先前播放状态
    AI->>LED: release AI 场景
